1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,932
Hi, we are team Milestone.

2
00:00:01,932 --> 00:00:05,793
Our challenge: find places on Earth that resemble base sites on the Moon and Mars.

3
00:00:05,793 --> 00:00:09,075
Lava Pit Atlas: the first base could be built inside a lava pit.

4
00:00:09,075 --> 00:00:14,195
We map 32 candidate pits on the Moon and Mars with NASA Trek, LROC and HiRISE data,

5
00:00:14,195 --> 00:00:17,028
and match each to Earth lava tubes, feature by feature.

6
00:00:17,028 --> 00:00:21,644
Best Mars candidate: Elysium, about 384 km from mapped ice.

7
00:00:21,644 --> 00:00:25,047
Next: rehearse on Earth, then build with local ice and regolith.

8
00:00:25,047 --> 00:00:28,800
Every number is sourced. No Mars cave is confirmed yet.
